# Paths inside the "Freigegebene Dokumente" library that the client may touch.
# Everything else in the finance team's library is out of scope: it is not ours to sync,
# and enumerating it on every run is slow enough to invite throttling.
#
# Verify a change here with a dry run before deploying it:
#   onedrive --synchronize --dry-run --verbose
#
Ressort Finanzen/97_Rechnungen_LB/Normal/*
